#==============================================================================================
#
#   html_text_area_element_1 - HTML::HTMLTextAreaElement: <textarea>, its value and attributes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/HTMLTextAreaElement.cpp (lines 1-336): construction (which moves the
#       mixin tables to HTMLTextAreaElement's, as C++'s vptrs move), the adjusted computed
#       style, focus, the reset and clear algorithms, cloning, the default value, value, raw
#       value and API value, maxLength/minLength/cols/rows and the selection bindings.
#       html_text_area_element_2 has the shadow tree, the children changed and attribute change
#       steps, edits, constraint validation, the layout node and the header's inline functions.
